# CANONICAL §7.3 fixture — `PlaceComponent` with `source.kind:"embedded"` (Component
# Library WP-3.2). SELF-GENERATING, no tracked binary (the place_component_profile
# pattern): plan 1 builds a 20x20x10 box, `ExportGeometry` bakes it to a worker-
# writable temp BRep, and plan 2 places those bytes back through the wire-only,
# NON-hashed `source.path` Rust injects from its materialised blob. `sha256` is a
# fixed digest literal: the worker reads the injected path, it does not re-hash.
# The placed body reports a volume; the cached source is the geometry authority. Refusal legs: a `brepFormat` the worker does not write and
# an EMPTY path (unmaterialised blob) fail only their own step, recoverably. The
# millimetres (exact volume) are pinned in worker/tests/test_component_blob_source.cpp.
# `document` differs from `embedded` only in record provenance fields.
